{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>11月18日，亞太經濟合作組織（APEC）工商領導人峰會在深圳舉行，目前正進行亞太經合組織經濟體領導人特別致辭。加拿大總理卡尼、澳洲總理阿爾巴尼斯、韓國總統李在明、越共中央總書記兼國家主席蘇林等APEC經濟體領導人將特別致辭。</p><figure><img alt=\"加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199720961113460736879451.png/fkLW5K1ZbFnVFztqYhLry5Lo720ioRUMiNNYzYjTWM0\"/><figcaption>加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199720958584164352465821.png/zdPka4Nm0z7vbkvUbH9TII44eZmB1kiacl9-v3Jffr8\"/><figcaption>加拿大總理卡尼致辭。（香港01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:06:32.084407+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":2,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:44:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:00:01.608364+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:00:01.608364+00:00","content_hash":"54a84d671afc821c8eb63ee6fd64b2745b56292554c60d2afa4d3d3ec030936e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}